            "text": "complexity_delta (repo-wide pmat analyze complexity, base a5efa1443 vs head f29aa41c9, filtered to the 673 changed paths): 235 threshold violations land in changed files at HEAD; 158 of those already existed at BASE (pre-existing, not introduced by this PR); 77 are net-new and every one of the 77 is in a file that git diff --diff-filter=A shows did not exist at BASE (new files, not modified ones). Worst two: scripts/test_apr_dogfood_lane_4252.py::main cognitive-complexity 255 (threshold 15/30 tiers), scripts/token_usage_report.py::claude cognitive-complexity 255. All 77 are Python tooling under scripts/ and scripts/lib/, not Rust under crates/, and .pmat-gates.toml's max_complexity=10 / TDG gates are the ones CI enforces on crates/; these scripts ship over pmat's general threshold but outside that enforced gate."
          },
